    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danyeli kūbalombela banhū bakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka go kwandya go ng'wa Dalio ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahasūlo, munhū wa lūganda lwa Bamedi, ūyo akatūūlwa kūbiza nsugi wa Bakalidayo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bakalidayo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, bana Babuloni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū mu ng'waka gwakwe go kwandya go būsugi, ū nene Danyeli nakitegeleja kūfuma mu Shandīkwa, ūmo gūhayīlile ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo akinhwa ng'hangi Yelemia, gīkī ī Yelusalemu īkwikala mu būkenaagūku kūshisha ikanza lya myaka makūmi mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūgalūka kūlī Seeba Mulungu nūng'wikūmbīlīja mu kūlomba na kūlombela, mu kūfunga na kūzwala shizwalo sha magūnīla na kwifudīka mu mabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūnomba ū SEEBA Mulungu wane na kūtambūūla nalīhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee Seeba, bebe ūyo ūlī Mulungu ntaale na wa lyogohya, ū bebe ūlīdimīīlile ī lilagane lyako lya būtogwa kū bose abo bakūtogilwe na kūshiigwa ī shilagīlo shako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūlī ba shibi hangī twakūhūba ū bebe; tūlī babūbi kūlwa kūkūgomela na kūgalūka, tūshileka ī shilagīlo shako na a malange gako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtabadegelekile a batūmami bako a bahangi, abo baahayaga mu lina lyako, bakūbawīlaga a batemi na a basugi bise, na a basīswe, na a banhū ba mu sī yise pye a bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Seeba ū bebe ūlī ntūngīlīja, alīyo a bise tūlī mu magooke gabūbi no gīt'ūmo tūlī ī lelo yenīyī banhū ba Būyudaya na Yelusalemu, nī Isilaeli ī yose; abo balī bbihī na a babo tūlī kūle, kū sī jose ūko watūsambaagīja kūlwa nguno ya būtūsanyiwa wise ū kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA, a bise na a batemi bise na a basugi bise, na a basīswe tūlī mu magooke kūlwa nguno ya kwīta shibi kū būtongi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba Mulungu wise ng'wene wa shigongo na nekeja wa banhū, nūūlū īkī tūlī bagomi ū kūlī we; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tūtībiigwi ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wise, nī shilagīlo shakwe īsho watwinha mu nzīla ya batūmami bakwe a bahangi tūtashidiimile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli a bose baalema ū kūkwigwa ū bebe, būgalūka būshikenaagūla ī shilagīlo shako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“H'ī chene a mazumo nū nsango, mihayo īyo yandīkilwe mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa ntūmami o ng'wa Mulungu shatūgwīlile, kūlwa nguno ya kwīta shibi ū kūlī Mulungu wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīshikīlīgije ī mihayo yako īyo yalī yahayiwa kūlwa kūtūhūgūla a bise na a basugi bise, ū twenhela būkenaagūji būtaale. Hose pyī ū mu mapande ayo galī ha sīlīlī y'igūlū gūtaalī kwītwa mhayo gīt'ūyo gwītilwe kū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būkenaagūji wenūbū watūgwīlile kūlenganīla nū mumo handīkīlilwe mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa, alīyo nahene tūtaalī ū kūgalūka nūūlū kūshileka ī shibi shise, gīkī tūng'wikūmbīlīje ū SEEBA Mulungu wise, mu nzīla ya kwīdīlīla ī ng'hana yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wise ng'wene ntūngīlīja mu yose īyo akīītaga, alīyo a bise tūtang'wigwaga, h'ī chene ū SEEBA atasusaanije ū kūtwenhela ū būkenaagūji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū Seeba Mulungu wise, bebe ūyo ūkabafunya banhū bako mu sī ya Misili na nkono gwa būdūla, wibeegeja lina lya kūshinga ho kūshisha lelo īyī; a bise twīta shibi, tūlī bahūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Seeba, ū kūlenganīla nū mumo shilī ī shītīle shako sha būtūngīlīja, būgalūchage ū būdaki wako nū būpelanu wako ūbo ūlī nabo kūlwa Yelusalemu ūyo gūlī nzengo gwako, na lūgūlū lwako lwela. Ī shibi shise nū būsoso wa basīswe h'īsho shenheleja ī Yelusalemu na a banhū bako, kūbiza shikolo sha kūsondagūlwa ū kū bose abo batūpīndije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulungu wise, igwaga ū kūlomba nū kwikūmbīlīja kwa ntūmami wako. Kūlwa nguno yako Seeba, līlolage mu kūlīsaatwa ī lipande lyako lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mulungu, tegaga gūtū wigwe; lolechaga a miso gako ūkūbone ū kūkenaagūlwa kwa nzengo ūyo gūkitanīlagwa kū lina lyako. Tūtūkwikūmbīlījaga īkī gīkī tūlī batūngīlīja, alīyo kūlwa nguno ya shigongo shako shitaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Seeba, igwaga! Ee Seeba, lekejaga! Ee Seeba, igwaga na kwīta! Kūlwa nguno yako, Ee Mulungu wane, yaya ū kūdīīla; nguno ū nzengo gwako na a banhū bako bakitanīlagwa kū lina lyako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mifungo makūmi mpungatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nalīyomba na kūlomba, kūnū nūshitambūūla ī shibi shane nī shibi sha banhū bane a Baisilaeli, na kūng'wikūmbīlīja ū SEEBA Mulungu wane kūlwa nguno ya lūgūlū lwakwe lwela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho nataalī ng'wikanza lya kūlomba, ū Gabulyeli, ū munhū ūyo naalī namona a ha wandījo mu shakoolechiwa, ūchwelemuka izile wangū aho naalī. Yalī bbihī n'ikanza lya shitambò sha mhīndī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla alīhaya, Danyeli, niza lūūlū kūkoolekeja na kūkwinha witegeleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlī gīkī, aho wandya dūhū ū kūlomba, shūfunyiwa shilagīlo, īsho niza kūkūmanīkīja ī haha, nguno ū bebe ūkūjiwe no. Alilūūlū, gwideedeng'hanyage ū mhayo nī shakoolechiwa ūshiitegeleje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
